cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KPViz, please cite the JCDL '26 paper listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "KPViz"
abstract: >-
  A local, reproducible cockpit for keyphrase extraction and generation
  evaluation: it scans dataset, model and architecture cards plus inference
  runs, derives an analytical store and serves explorers and research-question
  workbenches with camera-ready LaTeX/PGF export.
